{
  "analysis_id": "C01-PARTE2-CONFIRMATORIO",
  "description": "Confirmatory C01 Part II analysis, frozen (committed) before the sealed panel is opened. Primary score, as in the C01 design (research document section 12.4): success of the validation-selected checkpoint (best_B, 300k budget) on a new sealed panel of 64 task-B maps that no study panel contains, 4 sampling replicas per map (256 episodes per run). Contrasts, thresholds, families and Holm sizes are identical to C01-PARTE2-DESARROLLO, whose development-panel results were seen before this freeze. P3 was not run and still counts in the principal family (m = 3). The exploratory family, including the clock control, was added after an interim look and gets no verdict.",
